---
layout: base.njk
title: The Angular Plus Show
description: Listen to The Angular Plus Show — the home of ng-conf's official all-Angular podcast.
eleventyNavigation:
    key: The Angular Plus Show
    order: 5
---

<section class="page">
    <h1 class="page-title">The Angular Plus Show</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">
        The Angular Plus Show is the home of ng-conf's official all-Angular podcast. Come here to stay up to
        date on the latest changes in the Angular community — expect to laugh and cry with us as we talk
        about our experiences as Angular developers. With bonus episodes from The Dev Life podcast!
    </p>

    <div class="podcast">
        <iframe
            class="podcast__embed"
            src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/show/1PrLErQHBqBhZsRV1KHhGM?utm_source=generator&theme=0&t=0"
            width="100%"
            height="352"
            frameborder="0"
            allowfullscreen=""
            allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
            loading="lazy"></iframe>

        {% if episodes %}
            <div class="sec-header" id="episodes">
                <span class="sec-title">Latest Episodes</span>
                <div class="sec-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="post-list">
                {% for ep in episodes | head(5) %}
                    <article class="post-list__item">
                        <time class="post-list__date" datetime="{{ ep.date }}">{{ ep.date | readableDate }}</time>
                        <a class="post-list__link" href="{{ ep.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ ep.title }}</a>
                        {% if ep.description %}
                            <p class="post-list__description">{{ ep.description }}</p>
                        {% endif %}
                    </article>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</section>
